<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I just wanted to remind you that we have our next [<b>Masters without Arizona teacher certification</b>] Graduate Information Session coming up [<b>this week/next week</b>]. &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">This will be an in-person information session, and takes place tomorrow, [<b>Tuesday, September 16th, from 5:30pm-7:30pm in room 000 located in building XXX</b>]. &nbsp;This is the best way for you to gather important information about the program, and ensure you get your questions answered.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please take the time to&nbsp;<span id="docs-internal-guid-434391c6-d795-44b6-b760-20b6cc1217b0"><a href="http://education.asu.edu/resources/events" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">register</span></a></span>&nbsp;for this event and reserve a spot for yourself.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I look forward to having you join the session. &nbsp;If you have any questions or concerns please feel free to contact me!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Kindest regards,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Donna Parris &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Student Outreach Coordinator &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font> | <font color="#ffcc33">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College</font></b></font></div><div><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">donna.parris@asu.edu &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">480.727.1745 &nbsp;</span></div>]]></td>
